egister-the-device","content":"Confirm registration."},"1544":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#check-the-initial-status","content":"Open the device. It should appear in **No Identity** and show the selected owning DMS."},"1545":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#check-the-initial-status","content":"Registration creates the inventory entry; the certificate must still be associated."},"1546":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#assign-an-identity","content":"Select **Assign Identity** and the existing certificate with `CN=device-001`. Check its serial number, issuer and validity against the certificate you verified in PKI."},"1547":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#assign-an-identity","content":"Confirm the association. The **Issue New Instead** alternative is explained in Devices and identities."},"1548":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/regis