-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#opciones-de-línea-de-comandos","content":"`--softhsm-chart-path`"},"172":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#opciones-de-línea-de-comandos","content":"`./charts/softhsm`"},"173":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#opciones-de-línea-de-comandos","content":"Usa otro chart local de SoftHSM"},"174":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#opciones-de-línea-de-comandos","content":"Fastlane no ofrece un modo offline. Para entornos sin conexión, usa el flujo manual con Helm y prepara un registro y mirror de charts."},"175":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"`--development` ajusta el realm `lamassu` de Keycloak que genera Fastlane para un entorno de evaluación desechable:"},"176":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-98","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"el usuario `lamassu` queda completamente provisionado (nombre Lamassu, apellido Admin, email `lamassu@lamassu.io`, verificado): no hay pasos de perfil ni de cambio de contraseña en el primer inicio de sesión"},"177":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"la contraseña conocida `lamassu`/`lamassu` es fija y permanente: no se rota nunca y concede el rol `pki-admin`, incluidos tokens no interactivos a través del cliente `frontend`"},"178":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-100","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"el cliente `frontend` acepta cualquier redirect URI y cualquier origen web (`*`) en lugar de los patrones `/*` originales"},"179":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"Con `--development`, la contraseña fija `lamassu`/`lamassu` concede acceso `pki-admin` a cualquiera que alcance la instalación. No lo uses nunca en nada expuesto más allá de una máquina de desarrollo o de un host accesible por red."},"180":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"`--development` se aplica cuando el realm `lamassu` se importa por primera vez. No modifica un clúster existente. Puede combinarse con `--sample-data`: la transformación de desarrollo se ejecuta primero y después se añaden los datos de ejemplo a la misma configuración del realm."},"181":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"Fastlane:"},"182":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"valida las herramientas locales y el clúster seleccionado"},"183":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala o actualiza Envoy Gateway 1.8 y crea la `GatewayClass` `eg`"},"184":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-106","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"crea el namespace"},"185":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala PostgreSQL y crea las bases de datos necesarias"},"186":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala Keycloak y crea el realm `lamassu`, el cliente frontend, el rol administrador y el usuario inicial"},"187"