eployment/self-hosted/networking-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Usa un front door con SNI solo cuando los Gateways internos deban mantener políticas TLS o mTLS independientes:"},"302":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Esto requiere hostnames SNI distintos y configuración de red externa al chart de Lamassu."},"303":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si un Gateway puede gestionar TLS y el enrutamiento, usa el valor predeterminado del chart."},"304":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los Gateways necesitan políticas independientes y puedes asignar IP, usa una VIP por Gateway."},"305":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si solo necesitas separar los recursos Kubernetes, evalúa merged Gateway y usa tuplas de listener únicas."},"306":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/self-hosted/networkin