/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los valores genéricos solicitan 100 mCPU y 128 MiB y limitan a 500 mCPU y 512 MiB. Ajusta por servicio cuando haya OOMKills, throttling o arranques lentos."},"426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los motores KMS basados en filesystem y el almacenamiento local de VA utilizan volúmenes de acceso exclusivo. Mantén una réplica o migra a backends compartidos antes de habilitar autoscaling."},"427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos de dominio y auditoría dependen del publisher del bus:"},"428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"verifica que esté habilitado en el servicio emisor;"},"429":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"comprueba conectividad y credenciales AMQP;"},"430":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"revisa exchange, routing key, colas y consumidores;"},"431":{"id":"/docs/pr-prev